From ab7fa0d31be9417c0a3e468789faaae73167f52f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mita5358 <kafitcohr@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 23:07:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/20] fix(dsh): reveal one chunk when the rail jumps to a
 folded turn

A tick on a turn older than the open fold forced showAllMessages and a
full-history relayout, so on a titan record the click froze the TUI. The
click now asks the extension for the chunk that owns the placeholder row,
projects only that chunk over its placeholders, and seeks the projected
twin by event seq (placeholder ids do not survive materialisation).
